{"text": "Next, Soapy went into a cheap restaurant where the food was plain and the plates were thick. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He ate beefsteak, pancakes, doughnuts, and pie, and then he told the waiter that he had no money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now, call a policeman, said Soapy, and do not keep a gentleman waiting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Two waiters threw him out instead, and he landed on his left ear on the hard sidewalk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A policeman who stood nearby only laughed and walked away down the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After walking five blocks, Soapy found a young woman looking at a shop window, with a large policeman standing near her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soapy planned to bother her rudely, because he was sure that the policeman would arrest him for it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He fixed his tie, coughed loudly, and spoke to her boldly, glancing at the policeman again and again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To his surprise, the young woman happily took his arm and asked him to buy her something to drink. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the next corner Soapy shook off her arm and ran, for it seemed that he was doomed to freedom.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "x", "t", ",", " ", "S", "o", "a", "p", "y", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "c", "h", "e", "a", "p", " ", "r", "e", "s", "t", "a", "u", "r", "a", "n", "t", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "o", "d", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "p", "l", "a", "i", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "l", "a", "t", "e", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "i", "c", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "a", "t", "e", " ", "b", "e", "e", "f", "s", "t", "e", "a", "k", ",", " ", "p", "a", "n", "c", "a", "k", "e", "s", ",", " ", "d", "o", "u", "g", "h", "n", "u", "t", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "p", "i